n: verifica localmente, emite una credencial pseudonima, bloquea PII remota y prepara una denuncia inicial para escalar el caso en Guatemala sin enviar el CUI al servidor.&#10;Guarde capturas o mensajes sospechosos.&#10;Lleve DPI fisico y una copia de la denuncia al Ministerio Publico.&#10;Pida bloqueo preventivo si detecta creditos o cuentas no reconocidas.&#10;Comparta solo hechos redactados si una institucion nacional o aliado regional necesita apoyar.&#10;Trazas de herramientas&#10;agent.plan(victim) -&gt; validate_cui, local_breach_lookup, classify_identity_risk, select_privacy_route, draft_action_packet&#10;validate_cui(local_only) -&gt; valid_13_digits&#10;local_breach_lookup(asset:assets/breach_catalog.json) -&gt; 1_matches&#10;classify_identity_risk(CUI+correo+nombre+telefono) -&gt; Critico&#10;select_privacy_route(local_model) -&gt; pii_block_ok&#10;draft_action_packet(guatemala_identity_recovery) -&gt; citizen_steps+complaint_template&#10;agent.risk_level -&gt; Critico&#10;routing_decision(local_model) -&gt; confidence 92%, pii no&#10;trust_fabric.registry_check(local) -&gt; format_verified&#10;trust_fabric.pseudonymize(local) -&gt; zpk-gt-90afd7bcef90a162&#10;trust_fabric.did_document(local) -&gt; did:zpk:gt:zpk-gt-90afd7bcef90a162&#10;trust_fabric.vc_selective_disclosure(local) -&gt; 1_matches&#10;trust_fabric.sign_credential(hmac-sha256) -&gt; ok&#10;trust_fabric.keystore(android-keystore) -&gt; zpk-android-keystore-issuer-key-2026-05&#10;trust_fabric.verify_credential_signature(local) -&gt; ok&#10;trust_fabric.issue_consent(local, 15m) -&gt; signed&#10;trust_fabric.revocation_recovery(local) -&gt; Critico&#10;trust_fabric.institution_packet(redacted) -&gt; 1_matches&#10;select_legal_flow(local, victim)&#10;apply_experience_prior(tf-grpo) -&gt; 3 reglas&#10;gemma_agent_context(redacted) -&gt; national_identity_playbook&#10;fill_legal_template(local) -&gt; ready" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[42,1502][1038,2337]" drawing-order="0" hint=""><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="gt.kan.kan_app" content-desc="Modelo local" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[95,1638][451,1743]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="gt.kan.kan_app" content-desc="92% confianza" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[472,1638][856,1743]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></hierarchy>